\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {S3}{\ignorespaces  Adjusted predictive Poisson model comparison for (a) strong and (b) weak monsoon starts. Bars show \(\Delta \)AICc relative to the lowest-AICc model within each event catalogue. The event-process baseline contains same-type event history and Cheng composite sampling resolution~\citep  {cheng2016asian}; the adjusted climate model further includes LR04~\citep  {lisiecki2005pliocene} and \(\ce {CO2}\)~\citep  {bereiter2015revision}; and the full model adds precession phase~\citep  {laskar2004long}. Text boxes report the likelihood-ratio test for adding precession phase after event history, sampling resolution, LR04, and \(\ce {CO2}\). }}{8}{}\protected@file@percent }
