\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {S4}{\ignorespaces  Sensitivity of adjusted predictive Poisson models to additional forcings. (a,b) \(\Delta \)AICc for strong and weak monsoon starts, measured relative to the extended baseline containing event history, sampling resolution, LR04~\citep  {lisiecki2005pliocene}, \(\ce {CO2}\)~\citep  {bereiter2015revision}, and precession phase~\citep  {laskar2004long}. (c,d) Nested likelihood-ratio tests for the extra forcings. Bars show \(-\log _{10}(p)\), and the dashed line marks \(p=0.05\); bars to the left of this line are not significant. The three blocks test, from top to bottom, adding individual forcings to the extended baseline, adding all extra forcings jointly, and the unique contribution of each forcing within the full extended model. }}{9}{}\protected@file@percent }
